guarantee: invariant 1: a track file that cannot be opened is a storage failure, and nothing is left
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/storage.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
        let inner = open(path).map_err(|_| CreateError::Storage(StorageKind::Write))?;
--- new
